    "body": "This is effectively a duplicate of #1903, where Mustaq is already involved. I don't think it's worth introducing a Chromium-specific consumption concept to the spec if the eventual medium-term plan (in Chromium and elsewhere) is to drastically change the architecture.\r\n\r\nAs such, I'll close this, but am happy to reopen if you think it is somehow a separate issue.",
